# Example keys for Modal Secrets used by ``modal_app.py`` / ``modal_app_lite.py``.
# Do not commit real keys or URLs to git.
#
# AI analysis: NVIDIA keys are primary and round-robin. Default video model is qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b.
# Stellar Modal also mounts PatentPaper's ``ai-keys`` and ``patentpaper-all-secrets-latest`` secrets,
# so NVIDIA_API_KEY* may live there instead of ``custom-secret``.
NVIDIA_API_KEY=
NVIDIA_API_KEY_2=
NVIDIA_API_KEY_3=
NVIDIA_API_KEY_4=
NVIDIA_VIDEO_MODEL=qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b

# Optional explicit non-Gemini/Groq/Qwen video fallback pool. Entries must be video/vision capable.
# STELLAR_VIDEO_AI_KEYS_JSON=[{"provider":"openrouter","base_url":"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1","model":"...video-capable...","api_key":"...","video":true}]

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lite / Pro SwingNet（golfdb）— 可选
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 镜像 ``modal_app_lite.py`` 已在构建时 bake 默认路径：
#   /opt/stellar-weights/swingnet_1800.pth.tar
# 一般无需在 Secret 里再设。若要用 Volume 或其它绝对路径覆盖，可设：
# STELLAR_SWINGNET_CHECKPOINT=/models/swingnet_1800.pth.tar
